Output queue-demo.gif
Output queue-demo.txt

Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1250
Set Height 660
Set Padding 12
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set Shell "bash"

Type "# 22 dependency-bump PRs are open on mastodon/mastodon — which ones need a human?"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Type "lockvet queue mastodon/mastodon"
Enter
Sleep 16s
Sleep 4s
